{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RmXX2iM9tDTkXcuGMYANNx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Intent and evidence\n2\t\n3\tRead the workspace's agent instructions, `taskspec agent-context`, and current\n4\t`taskspec status --initiative <id>` before continuing an existing initiative.\n5\tFor small, understood changes, author one TaskPlan unit or use `taskspec new` directly.\n6\tDecomposition is optional; never invent lanes to fill a template.\n7\t\n8\tFor a broader outcome, collect the desired observable result, evidence sources,\n9\tconstraints, responsible owner, and unresolved material decisions. Use\n10\t`taskspec example intent --out intent.md`, then\n11\t`taskspec decompose init <id> --intent-file intent.md`. Standard input is accepted\n12\tas `--intent-file -`. An incident JSON file can be the explicit intake source.\n13\t\n14\tResearch the repository and author the decomposition recipe. Evidence needs source\n15\tidentifiers and exact digests for local files. Missing ownership, evidence, or\n16\tmaterial decisions is a blocker to explain, not a reason to invent an answer.\n17\tExternal information remains reported until independently checked. Store decisions\n18\tin the recipe so another harness can recover them without conversation history.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daa3f3ba-460c-4211-ade0-ebf68afc8b7c","uuid":"d7b65f32-c839-4a5b-9ba9-0ddcd0e335a9","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:28:03.857Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat pywtccg8/.agents/skills/task-spec/docs/guides/toolkit/intent.md","content":"# Intent and evidence\n\nRead the workspace's agent instructions, `taskspec agent-context`, and current\n`taskspec status --initiative <id>` before continuing an existing initiative.\nFor small, understood changes, author one TaskPlan unit or use `taskspec new` directly.\nDecomposition is optional; never invent lanes to fill a template.\n\nFor a broader outcome, collect the desired observable result, evidence sources,\nconstraints, responsible owner, and unresolved material decisions. Use\n`taskspec example intent --out intent.md`, then\n`taskspec decompose init <id> --intent-file intent.md`. Standard input is accepted\nas `--intent-file -`. An incident JSON file can be the explicit intake source.\n\nResearch the repository and author the decomposition recipe. Evidence needs source\nidentifiers and exact digests for local files. Missing ownership, evidence, or\nmaterial decisions is a blocker to explain, not a reason to invent an answer.\nExternal information remains reported until independently checked. Store decisions\nin the recipe so another harness can recover them without conversation history.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}}}
