{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UuYmStfbteLuyJur7VNMT9","type":"tool_result","content":"## example | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force]\n## new | mutation: creates one Task-Spec scaffold and derived state\n    Usage: taskspec new [--format 3|4] [--status ready|blocked] [--queue] <slug> <XS|S|M|L|XL|XXL> [agent] [source-note]\n## plan | mutation: none\n    Usage: taskspec plan --manifest <TaskPlan.yaml>\n## batch | mutation: creates declared Task-Spec scaffolds; --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec batch --plan <TaskPlan.yaml> | taskspec batch --intent-file <file> --effort <size>\n## gate | mutation: executes task evals; --stamp additionally writes the sign-off envelope\n    Usage: taskspec gate [--stamp] [--require-tier1] <task-spec>\n## accept | mutation: executes acceptance evals; --stamp additionally writes AcceptanceRecord/v1 and the acceptance envelope\n    Usage: taskspec accept [--stamp] [--handoff <file>] [receipt flags] <task-spec>\n## decompose | mutation: Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\n## decompose init | mutation: Create explicit intent workspace.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\n## decompose prepare | mutation: Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\n## decompose review | mutation: Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\n## decompose compile | mutation: Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\n## decompose status | mutation: none\n    Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\n## decompose impact | mutation: none\n    Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\n## decompose import | mutation: Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required.\n    Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\n## setup decompose | mutation: Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime.\n    Usage: taskspec setup decompose \n## example task-plan | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force]\n## example intent | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example intent --out <file> [--force]\n## example recipe | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example recipe --out <file> [--force]\n## example incident | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example incident --out <file> [--force]\n## example release-evidence | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example release-evidence --out <file> [--force]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daa3f3ba-460c-4211-ade0-ebf68afc8b7c","uuid":"4ea8c7e1-71e1-4b69-991a-8bf8aa6b21b8","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:28:26.224Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## example | mutation: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\n    Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force]\n## new | mutation: creates one Task-Spec scaffold and derived state\n    Usage: taskspec new [--format 3|